{"title":"Computer summer programs","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Computer summer programs</b>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#United_States_Computer_Summer_programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">United States Computer Summer programs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Elementary_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elementary school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Middle_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Middle school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#High_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">High school</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"United_States_Computer_Summer_programs\">United States Computer Summer programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: United States Computer Summer programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elementary_school\">Elementary school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</sp