s=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_Computer_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"National Computer Camp (page does not exist)\">National Computer Camp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nccamp.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SummerTech&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"SummerTech (page does not exist)\">SummerTech</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.summertech.net/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_school\">Middle school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Middle school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_Academy_Summer_Camps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Absolute Academy Summer Camps (page does not exist)\">Absolute Academy Summer Camps</a> in Fairfax County, VA, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.absoluteacademy.net/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Mathematics,_Science,_and_Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Center for Mathematics, Science, and Technology (page does not exist)\">Center for Mathematics, Science, and Technology</a> (CMST) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathismylife.org/index.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cybercamps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cybercamps (page does not exist)\">Cybercamps</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cybercamps.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\"