isual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Competitive_Programming_Bootcamp\" title=\"MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp\">MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/competitive-program/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Ethical_Hacking_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ Ethical Hacking Camp\">MehtA+ Ethical Hacking Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/intro-to-ethical-hacking/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_Computer_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"National Computer Camp (page does not exist)\">National Computer Camp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nccamp.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_Media_Tour&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"New Media Tour (page does not exist)\">New Media Tour</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.newmediatour.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Star_League_USACO_Camps_-_RESIDENTIAL_%26_DAY_CAMPS&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Star League USACO Camps - RESIDENTIAL &amp; DAY CAMPS (page does not exist)\">Star League USACO Camps - RESIDENTIAL &am